  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given curves are</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>y</mi></mfenced></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>a</mi></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0014_8f9fef80583b.png\" style=\"width: 234px; height: 270px;\" /></p><p>Now, required areas <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>[shaded area in the first quadrant]</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>a</mi></msubsup><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mi>a</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;[from Eqs. (i) and (ii)]</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>a</mi></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>a</mi></msqrt><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msqrt><mi>a</mi></msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mi>a</mi></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;sq units</p><p>Hence, option (a) is correct.</p>"
